{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-4836338","kind":"blog","title":"【活动】2016年日本博览会见闻","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-07-09","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Japan Expo見学！","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-4836338/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一结束采访后参观日本博览会，感受现场人潮、宝可梦展区与丰富的日本文化展示。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","イベント"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Japan Expo見学！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4836338.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160711102846id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4836338.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">昨天</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">活动结束后</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">有5家媒体采访</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">会场结束后</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">因为是在那之后去参观的……</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/001-c75e4b35e9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/001-c75e4b35e9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">一个人都没有！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这样的话</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">果然</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">也不能算是</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">参观过Japan Expo了啊……</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今天也去看看！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/002-0238fd52b8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/002-0238fd52b8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/003-ecca9ecaec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/003-ecca9ecaec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n人山人海！人！人！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/004-ec5a0a809d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/004-ec5a0a809d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nNintendo的展位也有！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/005-f7bd369665.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/005-f7bd369665.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n欧米伽红宝石·阿尔法蓝宝石的专区也有！\n\n<br>\n\n\n到处都是人！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n游戏、动画、漫画自不必说，\n服装、刀、毛绒玩偶、手办、\nCosplay、日本料理、传统工艺，\n应有尽有！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/006-747e74f884.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/006-747e74f884.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n舞台也有\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/007-5421bf6a16.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/007-5421bf6a16.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\nCosplay舞台，KITSUNÉ这个名字起得真棒！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/008-9050f920da.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/008-9050f920da.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n还有身穿和服表演舞蹈的舞台！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/009-600e5dec52.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4836338/009-600e5dec52.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n在宝可梦漫画方面一直给予帮助的KUROKAWA先生\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n啊——\n收获真大！\n也让我了解到日本在别人眼中是什么样子！\n\n<br>\n\n\n从日本以外的角度来看，\n手办和传统工艺\n似乎也变得很接近了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nJapan Expo，\n谢谢你们！\n我受到了很多很好的刺激！\n\n<br>\n\n\n现在要回日本了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\